  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 63900ac93b90d764abfce22b4b5e61b6, type: 3}
  m_Name: cutScene2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: 'jadi itu adalah moster karang turi. '
    pfp: {fileID: -8036185341388125364, guid: 1764f493c99d9ab48b023332f824f8d8, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: itu moster hasil perjanjian leluhur kami yang membuat lahan kami jadi subur
    pfp: {fileID: -8036185341388125364, guid: 1764f493c99d9ab48b023332f824f8d8, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: "dulu desa ini tidak bisa ditanami karna yaahhh, seperti yang kalian lihat,
      air di desa ini tidakbisadipakai dari dulu. \r"
    pfp: {fileID: -8036185341388125364, guid: 1764f493c99d9ab48b023332f824f8d8, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: jadi leluhur kami membuat perjanjian dengan moster itu untuk membuat tanah
      ini menjadi subur.
    pfp: {fileID: -8036185341388125364, guid: 1764f493c99d9ab48b023332f824f8d8, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: tapi dia membutuhkan tumbal setiap beberapa tahun.
    pfp: {fileID: -8036185341388125364, guid: 1764f493c99d9ab48b023332f824f8d8, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Tari
    text: "dan bapak mau numbalin kami? \r"
    pfp: {fileID: -1933487740984656095, guid: 5e312c1317de02f45a004d6a8d002e9f, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Bima
    text: "tega banget pak. \r"
    pfp: {fileID: -1297940572578557555, guid: 0fd1d630e19d6f54ead12da82edac19c, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: bapak minta maaf.
    pfp: {fileID: -8036185341388125364, guid: 1764f493c99d9ab48b023332f824f8d8, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: tapi ini satu 2nya cara untuk membuat desa ini jadi subur.
    pfp: {fileID: -8036185341388125364, guid: 1764f493c99d9ab48b023332f824f8d8, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: karna tidak mungkin menanan tanaman kalau kondisiair seperi ini.
    pfp: {fileID: -8036185341388125364, guid: 1764f493c99d9ab48b023332f824f8d8, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: nahh, kalo soal air pak
    pfp: {fileID: -647588791701333756, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: 'kami ada kenalan yang ngembangin teknologi pemurnian air pak. '
    pfp: {fileID: -647588791701333756, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: jadi desa ini gak perlu lagi perjanjian dengan moster itu.
    pfp: {fileID: -647588791701333756, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: gak mudah buat batalin perjanjian itu.ini perjanjian leluhur, bahkan saya
      gak tau caranya.
    pfp: {fileID: 8285764644026358973, guid: 8346703025be1ba4eba9772ca334deae, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Pak Edi
    text: gak mudah buat batalin perjanjian itu.ini perjanjian leluhur, bahkan saya
      gak tau caranya.
    pfp: {fileID: 8285764644026358973, guid: 8346703025be1ba4eba9772ca334deae, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 3375232501854110699, guid: 0f7a3a2d8dacd3342b94b339846a67c5, type: 3}
